What is the output with race condition?
```java
int counter = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++) {
  new Thread(() -> counter++).start();
}
Thread.sleep(100);
System.out.println(counter);
```

What does synchronized guarantee?
```java
synchronized (lock) {
  counter++;
}
```

