What is the output?
```java
CyclicBarrier barrier = new CyclicBarrier(2);
Thread t1 = new Thread(() -> {
  System.out.println("T1 starts");
  barrier.await(); // Wait for other thread
  System.out.println("T1 ends");
});
Thread t2 = new Thread(() -> {
  System.out.println("T2 starts");
